## Introduction:
A computer is an electronic machine that accepts raw data as input, processes it using instructions, stores the results, and outputs useful information.

## History:
Computers evolved from simple manual counting tools like the abacus into complex electronic systems capable of artificial intelligence.

## Types of computer:
The primary types of computers are classified by size and function into the following categories:
Supercomputer
Mainframe computer
Minicomputer
Microcomputer (Personal Computer)
